WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.700
[Wind across the open snow]

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.967 line:10% size:70%
Adler (on screen)  “Along the ridge to the next hut, while the weather holds. There should be oil in its store.”

00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:14.867
[Footsteps in the snow] A line of prints leads back across the slope.

00:00:15.233 --> 00:00:17.300
The ice bows underfoot.

00:00:17.433 --> 00:00:20.900
[Ice cracks. A splash.]

00:00:21.033 --> 00:00:22.767
The explorer hauls themself back onto the ice.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.833
[Wind rises] Powder streams off the roof.

00:00:30.433 --> 00:00:33.700
Inside the hut, the fuel crate holds four flasks.

00:00:34.533 --> 00:00:39.500
The stove lights. Its glow reaches the floorboards.

00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:45.833
[Wind outside the hut]

